WEBVTT

00:02.585 --> 00:03.294
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.378 --> 00:04.295
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.379 --> 00:05.338
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.422 --> 00:06.589
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:06.673 --> 00:08.925
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:09.008 --> 00:11.845
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.928 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.807
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.890 --> 00:17.767
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.851 --> 00:19.894
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.978 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.648
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.732 --> 00:25.608
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.692 --> 00:26.943
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.026 --> 00:28.319
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.403 --> 00:29.696
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.779 --> 00:31.698
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.781 --> 00:33.700
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.783 --> 00:37.287
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:54.387 --> 00:59.809
"And then,
the little ugly mollusk
ran all the way home."
“然后，
丑陋的小软体动物
一路跑回家。”

00:59.893 --> 01:02.437
SpongeBob, you got to see this!
海绵宝宝，你一定要看看这个！

01:02.520 --> 01:05.190
There's an emergency
broadcast on my TV.
有紧急情况
在我的电视上播放。

01:05.273 --> 01:08.067
Man:  The day you've been
waiting for is almost here.
男：你去过的那一天
等待的时间已经快到了。

01:08.151 --> 01:09.277
That's right.
这是正确的。

01:09.360 --> 01:11.029
Glove World has a new ride.
手套世界有了新的游乐设施。

01:11.112 --> 01:12.113
It's big.
它很大。

01:13.615 --> 01:14.866
It's fast.
速度很快。

01:16.242 --> 01:18.203
Harold, no!
哈罗德，不！

01:18.286 --> 01:19.579
It's painful.
很痛苦。

01:22.665 --> 01:26.920
It's the Fiery Fist O' Pain,
opening tomorrow,
only at Glove World.
这是炽热的痛苦之拳，
明天开业，
仅限手套世界。

01:27.003 --> 01:28.755
Tomorrow!
明天！

01:28.838 --> 01:32.926
SpongeBob, we got to get to bed
so we can be first in line.
海绵宝宝，我们得去睡觉了
这样我们就可以排在第一位。

01:35.094 --> 01:37.931
Glove World.
手套世界。

01:38.014 --> 01:41.184
Roller coaster.
过山车。

01:41.267 --> 01:43.269
First in line.
第一个排队。

01:53.530 --> 01:54.781
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

01:54.864 --> 01:57.033
Which way to the Fist O' Pain?
哪条路可以到达痛苦之拳？

02:14.592 --> 02:18.555
In the name of amusement, no!
以娱乐的名义，不！

02:25.979 --> 02:27.564
I don't want to ride
the Fiery Fist of Pain!
我不想骑
痛苦之火之拳！

02:31.484 --> 02:34.320
You ready to ride
the Fist of Pain?
你准备好骑行了
痛苦之拳？

02:34.404 --> 02:35.321
No!
不！

02:35.405 --> 02:36.948
Well, yeah.
嗯，是的。

02:37.031 --> 02:39.492
It's just that I had
a bad dream last night.
只是我曾经有过
昨晚做了一个噩梦。

02:39.576 --> 02:40.451
Really?
真的吗？

02:40.535 --> 02:41.744
Me too.
我也是。

02:41.828 --> 02:43.621
What was your dream
about, Patrick?
你的梦想是什么
关于，帕特里克？

02:43.705 --> 02:44.831
Oh, look, the bus is here!
哦，快看，公共汽车来了！

02:44.914 --> 02:46.666
SpongeBob: Wait for me, Patrick!
海绵宝宝：帕特里克，等等我！

02:46.749 --> 02:50.169
Whoo, Fiery Fist of Pain,
here we come!
呼，痛苦的火拳，
我们来了！

02:50.253 --> 02:51.629
Yeah, dudes.
是的，伙计们。

02:51.713 --> 02:53.923
We're all riding
the Fist O' Pain.
我们都在骑行
痛苦之拳。

02:54.007 --> 02:57.343
I heard somebody rode it
and his spine fell out.
听说有人骑过
他的脊椎骨脱落了。

02:57.427 --> 03:00.305
Dude, I hope my spine falls out.
伙计，我希望我的脊椎骨脱落。

03:00.388 --> 03:02.307
Yeah, me too.
是的，我也是。

03:02.390 --> 03:05.768
Boy, the Fist O' Pain
sure sounds...
男孩，痛苦之拳
当然听起来……

03:05.852 --> 03:07.770
...Really, really scary.
……真的、真的很可怕。

03:07.854 --> 03:09.230
I mean, "fun-ifying."
我的意思是，“有趣”。

03:09.314 --> 03:10.398
I mean, "hoi-tastic."
我的意思是，“hoi-tastic”。

03:10.481 --> 03:11.316
I mean, "funable."
我的意思是，“有趣”。

03:11.399 --> 03:12.358
Fun.
乐趣。

03:12.442 --> 03:13.401
Really, really fun.
真的，真的很有趣。

03:13.484 --> 03:15.612
Yeah, really fun.
是的，真的很有趣。

03:25.455 --> 03:27.582
That sure looks like fun.
这看起来确实很有趣。

03:27.665 --> 03:30.043
Yeah, I can't wait to ride it.
是的，我已经等不及要骑它了。

03:36.132 --> 03:39.052
Tickets, please.
请买票。

03:39.135 --> 03:40.219
No ticket.
没有门票。

03:40.303 --> 03:41.638
I must've left it at home.
我一定是把它忘在家里了。

03:41.721 --> 03:43.556
I swallowed my ticket.
我吞下了我的票。

03:43.640 --> 03:47.018
I guess we're not going to be
riding the Fist of Pain today.
我想我们不会
今天骑着痛苦之拳。

03:47.101 --> 03:48.561
Hold on a second.
等一下。

03:48.645 --> 03:50.688
Here's your tickets,
in your back pockets.
这是你的门票，
在你的后口袋里。

03:50.772 --> 03:54.609
Oh, barnacles.
哦，藤壶。

03:54.692 --> 03:58.363
It sure was lucky
we found our tickets.
确实很幸运
我们找到了我们的票。

03:58.446 --> 04:00.031
Yeah, bad luck.
是的，运气不好。

04:00.114 --> 04:02.075
I mean, good luck.
我的意思是，祝你好运。

04:02.158 --> 04:03.952
Very good luck.
祝你好运。

04:04.035 --> 04:05.078
There it is.
就在那里。

04:06.371 --> 04:08.122
That line looks awfully long.
这条线看起来非常长。

04:08.206 --> 04:09.749
Oh, I know.
哦，我知道。

04:09.832 --> 04:12.168
Let's go on some of
the dumb kiddie rides first.
让我们继续一些
傻孩子先骑。

04:12.251 --> 04:16.089
Yeah, and then, the Fist of Pain
will seem even cooler.
是的，然后是痛苦之拳
会显得更酷。

04:16.172 --> 04:17.548
Yeah.
是的。

04:17.632 --> 04:21.010
Phew.
唷。

04:21.094 --> 04:24.055
Can you believe some people are
afraid to ride roller coasters?
你能相信有些人是
害怕坐过山车？

04:24.138 --> 04:27.517
Yeah, only a real baby would
be afraid of roller... Whoa!
是的，只有真正的婴儿才会
害怕滚轮...哇！

04:27.600 --> 04:30.436
I can't believe it, Patrick.
我简直不敢相信，帕特里克。

04:30.520 --> 04:32.438
It's Glovie Glove.
这是格洛维手套。

04:32.522 --> 04:35.650
Get over there, and I'll take
your picture with him.
到那边去，我会带
你和他的合影。

04:35.733 --> 04:39.320
SpongeBob: Get closer, Patrick.
海绵宝宝：靠近一点，帕特里克。

04:39.404 --> 04:40.446
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

04:40.530 --> 04:42.949
SpongeBob: Come on, closer.
海绵宝宝：来吧，靠近点。

04:43.032 --> 04:43.992
That's it.
就是这样。

04:44.075 --> 04:45.118
A little more.
再多一点。

04:45.201 --> 04:46.828
Now hold on to his thumb.
现在抓住他的拇指。

04:46.911 --> 04:49.205
Give me a big smile.
给我一个大大的微笑。

04:49.288 --> 04:51.833
How do I look?
我看起来怎么样？

04:53.751 --> 04:55.545
Wow, I look great.
哇，我看起来棒极了。

04:58.589 --> 05:00.633
The Mitten!
手套！

05:01.843 --> 05:03.761
I mean, the Mitten.
我是说，连指手套。

05:03.845 --> 05:05.888
That ride's for babies.
那个骑行是给婴儿的。

05:05.972 --> 05:10.727
Yeah, let's ride it just
to see how "babyfied" it is.
是的，我们就骑它吧
看看它有多“婴儿化”。

05:39.380 --> 05:42.008
Hmph!
哼！

05:42.091 --> 05:46.179
I guess that ride was too much
for the little guy.
我想那趟旅程太多了
为了这个小家伙。

05:49.015 --> 05:51.517
Well, the line looks
a little bit shorter now.
嗯，这条线看起来
现在短了一点。

05:51.601 --> 05:54.228
Can you believe some people
are scared of this ride?
有些人你能相信吗
害怕这次骑行吗？

05:55.938 --> 05:57.774
Yeah, it's perfectly safe.
是的，这是绝对安全的。

05:57.857 --> 06:00.568
No one gets hurt riding
these "roly" coasters.
骑行时无人受伤
这些“不倒翁”杯垫。

06:00.651 --> 06:01.569
Why?
为什么？

06:01.652 --> 06:03.696
Why, why?
为什么，为什么？

06:06.699 --> 06:09.619
Why won't you
let me on the ride?
你为什么不
让我搭车吗？

06:09.702 --> 06:12.663
Sir, you have
a serious medical condition.
先生，你有
严重的健康状况。

06:12.747 --> 06:15.500
But it's my birthday.
但这是我的生日。

06:17.794 --> 06:19.212
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

06:19.295 --> 06:21.756
One more time!
再一次！

06:21.839 --> 06:24.217
You know, this is the line
for the bathroom.
你知道，这就是线
用于浴室。

06:25.343 --> 06:26.761
We've gone eight times.
我们已经去了八次了。

06:26.844 --> 06:29.972
And I went three times
all by myself.
而且我去了三次
全部由我自己。

06:30.056 --> 06:31.891
I'm going to walk away now.
我现在要走开。

06:31.974 --> 06:33.309
Bye.
再见。

06:33.392 --> 06:34.435
Larry: SpongeBob, Patrick!
拉里：海绵宝宝，帕特里克！

06:34.519 --> 06:35.937
Hello, Larry.
你好，拉里。

06:36.020 --> 06:38.397
I just got off the Fist O' Pain.
我刚从痛苦之拳下来。

06:38.481 --> 06:40.108
Man, what a rush.
伙计，真是太着急了。

06:40.191 --> 06:42.819
Ah.
啊。

06:42.902 --> 06:44.112
You smell that?
你闻到了吗？

06:44.195 --> 06:47.865
That's the smell of adrenaline.
那是肾上腺素的味道。

06:47.949 --> 06:51.119
Ooh, it's, um,
very manly, Larry.
哦，这是，嗯，
很有男子气概，拉里。

06:53.371 --> 06:56.749
SpongeBob, I'm not smelling
any adrenaline on you.
海绵宝宝，我没闻到
你身上有任何肾上腺素。

06:56.833 --> 06:58.584
You haven't gone on the ride?
你还没去搭车吗？

06:58.668 --> 07:03.172
Um, I have a confession to make.
嗯，我有件事要坦白。

07:03.256 --> 07:07.218
We haven't gone on the ride
because I'm hungry.
我们还没去搭车
因为我饿了。

07:07.301 --> 07:08.594
I'm very hungry.
我很饿。

07:08.678 --> 07:10.263
Hungry, hungry.
饿了，饿了。

07:10.346 --> 07:11.556
Come on, Patrick.
来吧，帕特里克。

07:11.639 --> 07:12.640
You and me, pal.
你和我，朋友。

07:12.723 --> 07:15.226
I'm hungry too.
我也饿了。

07:15.309 --> 07:17.019
Maybe I should stop
making people smell me.
也许我应该停下来
让人们闻到我的味道。

07:22.441 --> 07:23.401
Want some?
想要一些吗？

07:23.484 --> 07:24.944
No thanks, Patrick.
不，谢谢，帕特里克。

07:25.027 --> 07:27.113
Um, you've got ice cream
in your eyebrows.
嗯，你有冰淇淋
在你的眉毛里。

07:27.196 --> 07:30.283
Yeah, that's the problem
with this brand.
是的，这就是问题所在
与这个品牌。

07:30.366 --> 07:32.118
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

07:32.201 --> 07:35.288
Hurry back, so we
can go on the ride.
快点回来，所以我们
可以去搭车。

07:39.917 --> 07:41.586
"What's the matter, SpongeBob?"
“怎么了，海绵宝宝？”

07:41.669 --> 07:44.964
Oh, delicious dairy treat,
I don't know what to do.
哦，美味的乳制品，
我不知道该怎么办。

07:45.047 --> 07:46.591
"Patrick's your best friend.
“帕特里克是你最好的朋友。

07:46.674 --> 07:48.217
You can't let him down."
你不能让他失望。”

07:48.301 --> 07:51.429
I know, but the ride
is really scary.
我知道，但是骑行
真的很可怕。

07:51.512 --> 07:52.597
"You want to see scary?
“你想看恐怖的吗？

07:52.680 --> 07:53.973
I'll show you scary."
我会让你看到可怕的。”

07:54.056 --> 07:56.601
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.
噢，噢，噢，噢，噢。

07:56.684 --> 07:57.602
"You like that?
“你喜欢这样吗？

07:57.685 --> 07:58.477
You like that?
你喜欢这样吗？

07:58.561 --> 07:59.395
Huh?
啊？

07:59.478 --> 08:00.313
You like that?"
你喜欢这样吗？”

08:00.396 --> 08:01.731
It's just a ride.
这只是一个旅程。

08:01.814 --> 08:03.191
What are you so scared about?
你这么害怕做什么？

08:03.274 --> 08:04.650
You can do it.
你可以做到的。

08:04.734 --> 08:06.444
No, you can't.
不，你不能。

08:06.527 --> 08:08.279
You're a big crybaby.
你真是个爱哭鬼。

08:08.362 --> 08:09.780
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

08:11.407 --> 08:13.159
I thought we settled this
the last time.
我以为我们解决了这个问题
最后一次。

08:13.242 --> 08:14.202
Ow, quit it.
哎哟，别说了。

08:14.285 --> 08:15.203
Ow, quit it.
哎哟，别说了。

08:15.286 --> 08:16.162
Ow, quit it.
哎哟，别说了。

08:16.245 --> 08:17.747
Ow, quit it.
哎哟，别说了。

08:17.830 --> 08:19.332
SpongeBob, I have to
tell you something.
海绵宝宝，我必须
告诉你一些事情。

08:19.415 --> 08:20.666
I have to tell
you something, too, Patrick.
我必须告诉
你也一样，帕特里克。

08:20.750 --> 08:22.168
Man: Attention.
男：注意。

08:22.251 --> 08:24.795
Glove World will be closing
in five minutes.
手套世界即将关闭
五分钟后。

08:24.879 --> 08:27.089
Five minutes?
五分钟？

08:31.427 --> 08:33.596
SpongeBob: What are
you looking at?
海绵宝宝：什么是
你在看吗？

08:33.679 --> 08:35.348
Warning.
警告。

08:35.431 --> 08:38.434
This ride may cause crying,
screaming, projectile vomiting
这次骑行可能会让人哭，
尖叫、喷射性呕吐

08:38.517 --> 08:41.020
amnesia, spine loss,
embarrassing accidents,
uncontrollable gas...
健忘症、脊椎丧失、
尴尬的事故，
无法控制的气体...

08:41.103 --> 08:44.315
...and explosive diarrhea.
...以及爆发性腹泻。

08:45.441 --> 08:46.525
Is that all?
这就是全部吗？

08:46.609 --> 08:48.027
Big deal.
有什么大不了的。

08:48.110 --> 08:50.029
I did half that stuff
this morning.
我做了一半的事
今天早上。

08:50.112 --> 08:53.574
Man: Last call for
the Fiery Fist of Pain.
男：最后的电话
痛苦之火拳。

08:53.658 --> 08:56.244
Well, this is it, Pat.
嗯，就是这样，帕特。

08:56.327 --> 08:58.371
Yup.
是的。

08:58.454 --> 09:00.331
Here we go.
开始了。

09:00.414 --> 09:02.541
ah-Ha.
啊哈。

09:02.625 --> 09:06.337
On the Fiery Fist of Pain.
在痛苦的火拳上。

09:06.420 --> 09:09.882
After you.
您先请。

09:09.966 --> 09:11.133
We made it.
我们成功了。

09:11.217 --> 09:12.885
Yeah.
是的。

09:12.969 --> 09:16.180
Please keep your arms and legs
in the vehicle at all times.
请保留你的手臂和腿
始终在车内。

09:19.892 --> 09:21.352
There.
那里。

09:21.435 --> 09:23.271
Now if you could just
sign this release
现在如果你可以
签署此版本

09:23.354 --> 09:26.607
absolving Glove World in case
of accidental spine loss...
赦免手套世界以防万一
脊椎意外丢失...

09:26.691 --> 09:28.276
Well, nice knowing you.
嗯，很高兴认识你。

09:28.359 --> 09:29.568
Ready in 10.
10点准备好。

09:29.652 --> 09:30.695
Ooh, this is it, Patrick.
哦，就是这样，帕特里克。

09:30.778 --> 09:32.863
Nine... Eight...
九……八……

09:32.947 --> 09:33.906
We made it.
我们成功了。

09:33.990 --> 09:35.616
Seven... Six...
七……六……

09:35.700 --> 09:37.034
We're not scaredy-cats.
我们不是胆怯的猫。

09:37.118 --> 09:39.578
Five... Four...
五……四……

09:39.662 --> 09:40.997
We're not crybabies.
我们不是爱哭鬼。

09:41.080 --> 09:43.582
Three... Two...
三……二……

09:43.666 --> 09:45.293
We're brave.
我们很勇敢。

09:49.714 --> 09:52.425
Man: Uh, we're experiencing
some technical difficulties.
男：呃，我们正在经历
一些技术困难。

09:52.508 --> 09:55.928
Man, this cheap thing
is always breaking down.
老兄，这个便宜的东西
总是崩溃。

09:56.012 --> 09:57.471
Hey, sorry, guys.
嘿，对不起，伙计们。

09:57.555 --> 09:58.556
Maybe next time.
下一次吧。

10:00.433 --> 10:02.351
Patrick, I have
a confession to make.
帕特里克，我有
坦白。

10:02.435 --> 10:04.437
I was really scared
about going on this ride.
我真的很害怕
关于这次骑行。

10:04.520 --> 10:06.647
Me too.
我也是。

10:06.731 --> 10:10.026
I didn't know how
to tell you because, well,
I didn't want to disappoint you.
我不知道怎么办
告诉你因为，嗯，
我不想让你失望。

10:10.109 --> 10:12.945
I didn't want you
to be disappointed in me.
我不想要你
对我感到失望。

10:13.029 --> 10:14.947
But now we don't
have to face our fears.
但现在我们不
必须面对我们的恐惧。

10:15.031 --> 10:16.574
The ride is broken.
骑行坏了。

10:16.657 --> 10:17.616
Yeah!
是的！

10:17.700 --> 10:18.743
Oh, wait.
哦，等等。

10:18.826 --> 10:19.660
It's fine.
没关系。

10:19.744 --> 10:20.620
Huh?
啊？

10:20.703 --> 10:21.537
Have fun.
玩得开心。

10:23.289 --> 10:24.915
SpongeBob: Patrick, I don't
want to face my fears.
海绵宝宝：帕特里克，我不
想要面对我的恐惧。

10:24.999 --> 10:26.667
I'm afraid of 'em.
我害怕他们。

10:30.629 --> 10:32.131
Good-bye, Patrick.
再见，帕特里克。

10:32.214 --> 10:33.341
Good-bye, SpongeBob.
再见，海绵宝宝。

10:59.533 --> 11:02.870
Woman: Please wait until the car
has come to a complete stop.
女：请等一下车
已经完全停止了。

11:03.996 --> 11:05.664
And stop crying.
别哭了。

11:05.748 --> 11:06.749
It's over.
结束了。

11:06.832 --> 11:07.750
You can get out now.
你现在可以出去了。

11:07.833 --> 11:09.043
We did it!
我们做到了！

11:09.126 --> 11:10.628
We conquered our fears.
我们战胜了恐惧。

11:10.711 --> 11:12.922
We stopped crying.
我们停止哭泣。

11:13.005 --> 11:15.049
We survived the Fist O' Pain.
我们在痛苦之拳中幸存下来。

11:15.132 --> 11:16.175
Hey, hold it right there.
嘿，就拿在这儿吧。

11:16.258 --> 11:17.885
You forgot these.
你忘了这些。

11:17.968 --> 11:19.595
SpongeBob and Patrick:
Our spines.
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
我们的脊椎。

11:19.678 --> 11:21.806
Yeah.
是的。

11:25.142 --> 11:26.477
Let's go again.
我们再去吧。

11:26.560 --> 11:28.396
Yeah.
是的。

11:40.950 --> 11:44.620
Plankton: Oh, brother.
浮游生物：噢，兄弟。

11:44.703 --> 11:46.997
Just look at this place.
看看这个地方。

11:47.081 --> 11:49.375
Might as well be a mausoleum.
也可能是一座陵墓。

11:49.458 --> 11:51.127
Abysmal.
糟糕透了。

11:51.210 --> 11:54.463
Oh well, at least
it's structurally sound.
哦，好吧，至少
它结构合理。

11:55.297 --> 11:57.633
Forget this.
忘记这个吧。

11:57.716 --> 12:00.261
I'm sick of not
having any business.
我厌倦了不
有任何生意。

12:00.344 --> 12:02.888
Karen: Then why don't you
fix this rust bucket up?
凯伦：那你为什么不呢？
修理这个生锈的桶吗？

12:02.972 --> 12:04.390
Look around.
环顾四周。

12:04.473 --> 12:08.727
Chipping paint, bad plumbing,
dust bunnies.
油漆剥落、管道不良、
灰尘兔子。

12:08.811 --> 12:11.814
It's no wonder you don't
have any customers.
难怪你不
有任何客户。

12:11.897 --> 12:14.733
OK, I get it, I get it.
好吧，我明白了，我明白了。

12:14.817 --> 12:17.903
It's time to give this place
a complete overhaul.
是时候放弃这个地方了
彻底检修。

12:24.034 --> 12:26.036
Whoa.
哇哦。

12:30.499 --> 12:34.545
I shouldn't have to subject
myself to such menial labor.
我不应该屈服
我自己从事这种卑微的劳动。

12:43.095 --> 12:44.597
This is a job for an imbecile.
这是一个低能者的工作。

12:49.894 --> 12:52.062
Or two imbeciles.
或者两个低能儿。

12:53.772 --> 12:56.275
Excuse me, gentlemen.
对不起，先生们。

12:56.358 --> 13:00.821
I am sorry to bother you,
but I'm having a bit of trouble
with my abode.
很抱歉打扰你
但我遇到了一点麻烦
与我的住处。

13:00.905 --> 13:05.326
You see,  , I would
like to paint the Chum Bucket
你看，我会
喜欢画密友桶

13:05.409 --> 13:09.872
to please my wife, but alas,
I am too small and feeble.
为了取悦我的妻子，但可惜的是，
我太小太虚弱了。

13:11.290 --> 13:14.043
Oh, well, we can help you.
哦，好吧，我们可以帮助你。

13:14.126 --> 13:14.960
Right, Patrick?
对吧，帕特里克？

13:15.044 --> 13:16.420
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

13:16.504 --> 13:19.798
I came prepared, too.
我也是有备而来。

13:19.882 --> 13:22.218
All right, let's do it.
好吧，我们开始吧。

13:22.301 --> 13:26.347
OK, boys, Karen wants this place
to really sparkle.
好吧，孩子们，凯伦想要这个地方
真正闪闪发光。

13:26.430 --> 13:30.809
I was thinking it could use
a little more pizzazz.
我以为它可以用
多一点活力。

13:30.893 --> 13:33.187
Pizzazz, yeah.
披萨，是的。

13:33.270 --> 13:35.231
Hey, I know.
嘿，我知道。

13:35.314 --> 13:37.983
Why don't you paint
the entire Chum Bucket?
你为什么不画画
整个密友桶？

13:38.067 --> 13:40.486
Whoa, really?
哇，真的吗？

13:40.569 --> 13:44.031
Oh, yes, I need
your artistic vision.
哦，是的，我需要
你的艺术视野。

13:44.114 --> 13:48.244
You wouldn't want to disappoint
my Karen, now, would you?
你不想让你失望
我的凯伦，现在，你愿意吗？

13:48.327 --> 13:49.995
No, uh-uh.
不，呃呃。

13:50.079 --> 13:51.747
Well, hop to it, lads.
好吧，跳吧，小伙子们。

13:51.830 --> 13:52.998
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

13:53.082 --> 13:54.667
Woop-woop-woop-woop.
呜呜呜呜呜。

13:54.750 --> 13:58.337
Heel, toe, heel, toe, heel, toe,
heel, toe, heel, toe.
脚跟，脚趾，脚跟，脚趾，脚跟，脚趾，
脚跟，脚趾，脚跟，脚趾。

13:58.420 --> 14:00.798
SpongeBob and Patrick:
♪ Tra-la-la-la-la,
tra-la-la-la-la ♪
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

14:00.881 --> 14:03.008
♪ We love to work ♪
♪ 我们热爱工作 ♪

14:03.092 --> 14:04.426
What the...?
什么……？

14:04.510 --> 14:08.013
SpongeBob, what atrocity
is this?
海绵宝宝，什么暴行
这是吗？

14:08.097 --> 14:09.640
Oh, hi, Squidward.
哦，嗨，章鱼哥。

14:09.723 --> 14:10.641
"Lookie."
“瞧瞧。”

14:10.724 --> 14:11.976
Mr. Plankton's having us paint.
浮游生物先生让我们画画。

14:12.059 --> 14:14.603
He calls it pizzazz.
他称之为“活力四射”。

14:14.687 --> 14:17.147
Pizzazz, huh?
披萨，是吧？

14:17.231 --> 14:19.233
What would you know about that?
你对此有何了解？

14:19.316 --> 14:22.361
Plankton says he needs
our artistic vision.
浮游生物说他需要
我们的艺术视野。

14:22.444 --> 14:24.029
Let's show him.
让我们给他看看。

14:26.282 --> 14:30.077
You buffoons wouldn't know
artistic vision if it hit you
over the head.
你们这些小丑不会知道
艺术视觉如果它击中你
过头顶。

14:30.160 --> 14:31.829
Now, where's a paintbrush?
现在，画笔在哪里？

14:31.912 --> 14:35.332
I'll show you what
artistic vision is all about.
我会告诉你什么
艺术视觉就是一切。

14:35.416 --> 14:39.169
Start with light brush strokes.
从轻的笔触开始。

14:39.253 --> 14:41.797
Oh.
哦。

14:41.880 --> 14:45.009
Yeah, perfect.
是的，完美。

14:45.092 --> 14:47.928
Simpletons.
傻瓜们。

14:48.012 --> 14:49.471
Amazing.
惊人的。

14:49.555 --> 14:51.765
I didn't even have to trick
the tall one.
我什至不需要欺骗
个子高的。

14:53.267 --> 14:55.978
My plan is falling
right into place.
我的计划落空了
就位。

14:56.061 --> 15:00.065
With those three boobs
preoccupied, stealing
the formula will be a snap.
有了这三个胸
专心致志、偷窃
公式会很简单。

15:00.149 --> 15:01.567
SpongeBob: Mr. Plankton?
海绵宝宝：浮游生物先生？

15:01.650 --> 15:03.902
All this hard work
is making us thirsty.
所有这些辛苦的工作
让我们口渴。

15:03.986 --> 15:06.739
Do you think
we could get a drink?
你认为
我们可以喝一杯吗？

15:06.822 --> 15:09.491
Let me show you
something, SpongeBob.
让我告诉你
某事，海绵宝宝。

15:09.575 --> 15:15.080
I sure wish I could offer you
a cold drink for all
your hard work
我确实希望我能为你提供
给所有人一杯冷饮
你的辛勤工作

15:15.164 --> 15:19.084
but alas, my pipes
are rusted shut.
但唉，我的烟斗
都生锈了。

15:20.878 --> 15:22.338
Ooh, I see what you mean.
哦，我明白你的意思了。

15:22.421 --> 15:27.301
Yes, if only there was
some way I could...
是的，如果有的话
某种方式我可以...

15:27.384 --> 15:28.719
Where'd he go?
他去哪儿了？

15:28.802 --> 15:30.095
♪ La-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

15:33.015 --> 15:35.517
♪ La-la-la, la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦，啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

15:59.541 --> 16:02.169
Secret formula, here I come.
秘方我来了

16:06.882 --> 16:09.843
SpongeBob: ♪ La-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la, la-la-la ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦♪

16:09.927 --> 16:11.095
Perfect.
完美的。

16:11.178 --> 16:13.681
Huh?
啊？

16:15.224 --> 16:18.018
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

16:18.102 --> 16:19.853
It's all wrong.
一切都是错误的。

16:19.937 --> 16:22.189
Don't you know
a thing about art?
你不知道吗
关于艺术的事情？

16:22.272 --> 16:24.316
Give me that brush.
把那把刷子给我。

16:26.235 --> 16:30.155
Yes, yes, and yes.
是的，是的，是的。

16:30.239 --> 16:33.325
Voila.
瞧。

16:33.409 --> 16:35.661
A log cabin?
小木屋？

16:35.744 --> 16:38.080
Yeah, I just think
they're so cozy.
是的，我只是觉得
他们很舒服。

16:38.163 --> 16:40.999
Now, that's what you call art.
现在，这就是你所谓的艺术。

16:41.083 --> 16:43.001
Everyone's a critic.
每个人都是批评家。

16:43.085 --> 16:46.088
I can't wait to see
Krabs's face when he discovers
我等不及要看
蟹老板发现后的表情

16:46.171 --> 16:49.883
that I've absconded with
the secret Krabby Patty formula.
我已经潜逃了
秘制蟹黄派配方。

16:49.967 --> 16:51.301
SpongeBob: Hey, Plankton.
海绵宝宝：嘿，浮游生物。

16:51.385 --> 16:52.678
What do you think
of the new window?
你觉得怎么样
新窗口的？

16:52.761 --> 16:55.431
We got it from the Krusty Krab.
我们从 Krusty Krab 那里得到的。

16:55.514 --> 16:59.601
SpongeBob, how do you
expect me to see out of
a window that high?
海绵宝宝，你怎么样
期待我看到
窗户那么高？

16:59.685 --> 17:01.895
I guess I hadn't
thought about that.
我想我没有
想到了这一点。

17:01.979 --> 17:02.980
Patrick: I did.
帕特里克：我做到了。

17:03.063 --> 17:04.565
Look, Plankton.
看，浮游生物。

17:04.648 --> 17:06.400
It's the perfect height
for your kind.
这是完美的高度
为了你的同类。

17:06.483 --> 17:07.693
See, SpongeBob?
看到了吗，海绵宝宝？

17:07.776 --> 17:09.903
Patrick's using the old noggin.
帕特里克正在用旧脑子。

17:09.987 --> 17:13.699
He knows I'll actually want
to see out the window.
他知道我实际上想要
看看窗外。

17:14.116 --> 17:18.328
Wait, you wanted
to see out the window?
等等，你想要的
看窗外？

17:18.412 --> 17:19.246
Weird.
诡异的。

17:23.292 --> 17:24.543
Uh...
呃...

17:27.796 --> 17:31.550
Can't you two do anything right?
你们两个就不能做点什么吗？

17:31.633 --> 17:34.845
I give you one simple task
after another, and...
我给你一项简单的任务
又一个，然后……

17:34.928 --> 17:38.057
Just forget it.
忘记它吧。

17:38.140 --> 17:41.727
It was foolish of me to think
this plan would ever work
我这样想真是愚蠢
这个计划会奏效

17:41.810 --> 17:45.564
when nothing else in my life
has panned out.
当我的生活中没有其他事情的时候
已经成功了。

17:45.647 --> 17:51.153
Telemarketing, lifeguarding,
creative writing,
all such bitter failures.
电话营销、救生、
创意写作，
所有这些痛苦的失败。

17:56.700 --> 17:59.995
Oh, it's OK,
little, green... creature.
哦，没关系，
小的、绿色的……生物。

18:00.078 --> 18:02.915
Patrick and I are gonna
keep working on the Chum Bucket
帕特里克和我要去
继续研究“密友桶”

18:02.998 --> 18:06.919
until it's
the most "pizzazziest"
restaurant in bikini bottom.
直到它
最“热闹”的
比基尼下装的餐厅。

18:09.004 --> 18:09.922
really?
真的吗？

18:10.005 --> 18:11.757
And how.
以及如何。

18:11.840 --> 18:14.760
Come on, fellows, let's do
some interior decorating.
来吧，小伙伴们，我们一起做吧
一些室内装饰。

18:14.843 --> 18:17.596
Oh, good-bye, paintbrush.
哦，再见，画笔。

18:17.679 --> 18:19.765
Hello, antique finish.
你好，仿古饰面。

18:25.187 --> 18:29.650
Well, that ought to keep them
busy for a while.
好吧，这应该让他们
忙了一段时间。

18:29.733 --> 18:33.737
Hup-hup-hup-hup,
hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

18:33.821 --> 18:35.864
Hup-hup.
嘻哈。

18:37.699 --> 18:40.911
Hup-hup-hup-hup,
hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

18:42.746 --> 18:47.251
I just need to sneak past Krabs
and I'm home free.
我只需要偷偷溜过蟹蟹
我现在自由了。

18:47.334 --> 18:49.002
Hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

18:54.091 --> 19:01.473
Hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

19:01.557 --> 19:05.060
Where could that stingy crab be?
那只吝啬蟹会在哪里呢？

19:05.144 --> 19:08.480
Hup-hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

19:23.871 --> 19:25.122
Still don't see him.
还是不见他。

19:25.205 --> 19:27.040
Hup-hup-hup-hup-hup.
哈-哈-哈-哈-哈。

19:29.334 --> 19:30.586
The safe.
保险箱。

19:30.669 --> 19:33.046
I'm in the clear, baby.
我很清楚，宝贝。

19:36.592 --> 19:40.053
It's beautiful.
很美丽。

19:40.137 --> 19:42.848
No, no tears.
不，没有眼泪。

19:42.931 --> 19:45.601
Not yet.
还没有。

19:45.684 --> 19:47.603
There's work to be done.
还有工作要做。

19:53.275 --> 19:54.776
At long last.
终于。

19:56.987 --> 20:01.742
And the secret formula is,
one bottle of molting lotion.
秘密公式是，
一瓶蜕皮乳液。

20:01.825 --> 20:04.453
Take passport photo.
拍摄护照照片。

20:04.536 --> 20:07.247
Get new safe, travel size.
购买新的旅行保险箱。

20:07.331 --> 20:10.208
This isn't the secret formula.
这不是秘密公式。

20:10.292 --> 20:12.377
It's a to-do list.
这是一个待办事项清单。

20:20.218 --> 20:21.637
Huh?
啊？

20:21.720 --> 20:24.056
What happened to
the Krusty Krab?
发生了什么事
蟹堡王？

20:26.433 --> 20:28.810
What happened to
the Chum Bucket?
发生了什么事
密友桶？

20:32.606 --> 20:34.149
Plankton: Curses.
浮游生物：诅咒。

20:34.232 --> 20:36.568
This isn't what I meant
by renovation.
这不是我的意思
通过翻新。

20:36.652 --> 20:39.655
I know, isn't it great?
我知道，这不是很好吗？

20:39.738 --> 20:41.740
It looks just like
the Krusty Krab.
它看起来就像
蟹堡王。

20:41.823 --> 20:45.160
Mr. Krabs: It looks more like
Plankton trying to steal
me restaurant.
蟹老板：看起来更像是
浮游生物试图偷窃
我的餐厅。

20:47.329 --> 20:50.666
Mr. Krabs, you've returned
from your vacation.
蟹老板你回来了
从你的假期开始。

20:52.668 --> 20:56.838
And it's time for
the Krusty Krab to return
from  its  vacation.
现在是时候了
蟹堡王回归
从它的假期开始。

21:07.683 --> 21:09.643
Hooray.
万岁。

21:09.726 --> 21:14.314
And I bet you tried
to steal this too.
我打赌你尝试过
也来偷这个。

21:16.108 --> 21:18.443
Well, "steal" is such
a strong word.
嗯，“偷”就是这样
一个强烈的词。

21:20.862 --> 21:26.493
You don't really think I'd leave
me secret formula behind
when I go on vacation, do you?
你真的认为我不会离开
我背后的秘密公式
当我去度假时，你呢？

21:26.576 --> 21:27.619
Now, stay away from me...
现在，离我远点……

21:27.703 --> 21:29.288
...restaurant, bug.
...餐厅，虫子。

21:29.371 --> 21:31.665
I think we've been
through this before.
我想我们已经
之前通过这个。

21:31.748 --> 21:33.583
Allow me to do the honors.
请允许我履行这一荣誉。

21:35.252 --> 21:39.047
Ahh...
啊...

21:40.340 --> 21:42.801
Oh, excellent job, genius.
哦，干得好，天才。

21:42.884 --> 21:45.387
You really fixed the place up.
你真的把这个地方修好了。

21:45.470 --> 21:46.722
Don't nag me, Karen.
别跟我唠叨，凯伦。

21:46.805 --> 21:48.390
I've had a long day.
我度过了漫长的一天。

21:52.269 --> 21:55.313
Yep, Squidward,
you really outdid yourself
with the new decor.
是的，章鱼哥，
你真的超越了自己
与新的装饰。

21:55.397 --> 21:57.441
Where'd you get the fountain?
你从哪里得到的喷泉？

21:57.524 --> 22:00.485
That, I sculpted out of
the concrete foundation
of the Chum Bucket.
那是我雕刻出来的
混凝土基础
密友桶的。

22:00.569 --> 22:02.571
And all these metal decorations?
还有所有这些金属装饰品？

22:02.654 --> 22:05.699
Those were all fabricated
from the Chum Bucket walls.
那些都是编造的
从 Chum Bucket 的墙上。

22:05.782 --> 22:06.950
And the computer?
电脑呢？

22:07.034 --> 22:08.994
Oh, that's Plankton's wife.
哦，那是浮游生物的妻子。

22:09.077 --> 22:12.622
Well, it looks great, lad,
and it didn't cost me a dime.
嗯，看起来很棒，小伙子
而且我没花一毛钱。

22:12.706 --> 22:16.334
Wow, $25 for a Krabby Patty?
哇，25 美元一份蟹肉饼？

22:16.418 --> 22:17.544
Ripoff, dude.
盗版，伙计。

22:17.627 --> 22:19.296
Not cool.
不酷。

22:19.379 --> 22:22.591
But you're paying for
the enhanced ambience, dude.
但你正在付出代价
增强的氛围，伙计。

22:22.674 --> 22:23.842
Well, that's true.
嗯，确实如此。

22:23.925 --> 22:25.635
It is pretty classy in here.
这里非常优雅。

22:25.719 --> 22:26.803
Give me four.
给我四个。

给我四个。